      "blurb": "Quarian Migrant Fleet combat marine",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Quarian marines are defenders of a fleet that cannot afford to lose ships or personnel. They fight with the intensity that comes from knowing that every hull breach and every death is one step closer to a crisis the fleet cannot absorb. Their technical training extends into combat-they are capable of disrupting enemy hardware while maintaining weapons fire.</p><p><strong>Suit Integrity:</strong> +2 circ. bonus to Fortitude saves vs. disease and poison.</p><p><strong>Emergency Evacuation:</strong> Reaction-when reduced below 1/4 HP, immediately Stride up to full Speed without provoking reactions.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 40 Shield HP. Recharges 12 HP per turn.</p>",
